                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلْكٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Dominion; sovereignty; kingship; rule;
mastership; ownership; possession; right of possession; authority; sway.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلْكُ ٱللّٰهِ</span>
                        <i>God's
world of spirits; or invisible world.</i> (TA, art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شهد</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلْكٌ</span> (when distinguished from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ملكوت</span>)
